            "Suppose you are invited to put forward a proposal to the university on how to make students' campus life easier. You are now to write an essay to make your proposal. You will have 30 minutes to write the essay. You should write at least 120 words but no more than 180 words.",
          promptZh:
            "假设你受邀向学校提交一份提案，主题是“如何让学生校园生活更便利”。请写一篇短文提出你的建议。",
          modelEssay: `College life can be busy and stressful, so small improvements on campus can make a big difference. I would like to propose two practical measures.

First, the university should extend the opening hours of libraries and study rooms during exam weeks. Many students find it hard to concentrate in crowded dormitories, and a quiet seat late at night would help them prepare more effectively. Second, a single campus app should be developed to bring together canteen payment, laundry service, room reservation and campus notices. At present, students have to switch between several platforms, which wastes time and causes confusion.

These changes do not require huge investment, but they would greatly improve daily convenience. I hope the university will consider my proposal and make campus life easier for everyone.`,
