        "promptEn": "Suppose your university is organizing a forum on how students can make the best use of on-campus resources for academic development. You are now to write an essay to express your view. You will have 30 minutes to write the essay. You should write at least 120 words but no more than 180 words.",
        "promptZh": "学校举办论坛讨论如何善用校园资源促进学业发展，请写文章表达你的观点。",
        "modelEssay": "On-campus resources are a treasure that too many students overlook. In my view, actively making use of these facilities is one of the smartest ways to boost our academic development.\n\nThere are several practical steps we can take. First, we should visit the library and its online databases regularly, since they offer academic papers and books that turn a rough idea into a well-supported argument. Moreover, we ought to consult professors during their office hours, because a ten-minute talk often clears up confusion that hours of self-study cannot. In addition, attending academic lectures and joining study groups exposes us to fresh perspectives and keeps our motivation high.\n\nIn short, the campus is full of tools waiting to be used. Only by taking the initiative to utilize them can we truly grow as learners and get the most out of our university years.",
        "modelEssayZh": "校内资源是一座被太多学生忽视的宝藏。在我看来，主动利用这些设施，是提升我们学业发展最聪明的方式之一。\n我们可以采取几项切实可行的做法。首先，我们应当经常光顾图书馆及其在线数据库，因为它们提供的学术论文和书籍能把一个粗糙的想法变成有充分支撑的论证。此外，我们应当在教授的答疑时间当面请教，因为一次十分钟的交流，往往能解开数小时自学都绕不过去的困惑。再者，参加学术讲座、加入学习小组能让我们接触到新视角，并保持高昂的学习动力。\n总之，校园里满是等待被利用的工具。只有主动去利用它们，我们才能真正作为学习者成长，把大学时光用到极致。",
