        "promptEn": "Suppose your university is organizing a forum on the development of students' cross-cultural communication abilities. You are now to write an essay to express your view. You will have 30 minutes to write the essay. You should write at least 120 words but no more than 180 words.",
        "promptZh": "学校举办关于培养学生跨文化沟通能力的论坛，请写文章表达你的观点。",
        "modelEssay": "In an era of deepening globalization, the ability to communicate across cultures has become indispensable. I firmly believe that universities should attach great importance to developing students' cross-cultural communication abilities.\n\nFor one thing, such competence helps reduce misunderstandings rooted in different customs and values, making cooperation smoother. For instance, when I joined an international online project, teammates from three countries reached agreement quickly only because we respected each other's communication styles. For another, in today's competitive job market, graduates who can embrace diversity and work with global partners clearly stand out.\n\nTherefore, we students should seize every chance to broaden our horizons, such as joining exchange programs, reading foreign works, or making friends with international students. Only by becoming true global citizens can we thrive in a connected world.",
        "modelEssayZh": "在全球化不断加深的时代，跨文化沟通的能力已变得不可或缺。我坚信，大学应当高度重视培养学生的跨文化交际能力。\n一方面，这种能力有助于减少因不同习俗和价值观而产生的误解，使合作更加顺畅。例如，当我参加一个国际线上项目时，来自三个国家的队友之所以能迅速达成一致，正是因为我们尊重彼此的沟通方式。另一方面，在当今竞争激烈的就业市场，能够拥抱多元、与全球伙伴共事的毕业生明显更为出众。\n因此，我们大学生应抓住每一个机会开阔视野，比如参加交流项目、阅读外国作品，或与国际学生结交朋友。唯有成为真正的全球公民，我们才能在这个互联互通的世界中立足并蓬勃发展。",
