        "promptEn": "Suppose the university newspaper is inviting submissions from the students for its coming edition on how to enrich students' knowledge of traditional Chinese culture. You are now to write an essay for submission. You will have 30 minutes to write the essay. You should write at least 120 words but no more than 180 words.",
        "promptZh": "校报下期征稿：如何丰富学生对中国传统文化的了解，请写一篇文章投稿。",
        "modelEssay": "Traditional Chinese culture is a treasure that shapes our national identity, yet many students today know little about it. As a contributor to our university newspaper, I would like to share several practical ways to enrich students' understanding of this precious heritage.\n\nTo begin with, our university could offer optional courses and regular lectures on classical literature, calligraphy and traditional festivals, so as to build a solid foundation of knowledge. In addition, hands-on activities are equally important. By organizing cultural experiences such as paper-cutting workshops or tea ceremonies, students can feel the charm of tradition rather than merely reading about it. Moreover, we can make full use of new media, posting short videos and articles online to spread cultural knowledge in a way that appeals to young people.\n\nIn conclusion, combining formal learning, personal experience and modern technology would help students appreciate traditional Chinese culture far more deeply. I sincerely hope these suggestions will benefit us all.",
        "modelEssayZh": "中华传统文化是塑造我们民族身份的瑰宝，然而如今许多学生对它知之甚少。作为校报的一名投稿人，我想分享几条丰富学生对这份珍贵遗产认知的实用办法。\n首先，学校可以开设古典文学、书法和传统节日方面的选修课与定期讲座，以打下扎实的知识基础。此外，动手体验同样重要。通过组织剪纸工作坊、茶艺等文化体验活动，学生能真切感受传统的魅力，而不只是纸上读到。而且，我们可以充分利用新媒体，在网上发布短视频和文章，以年轻人喜欢的方式传播文化知识。\n总之，把正规学习、亲身体验与现代技术结合起来，将帮助学生更深地欣赏中华传统文化。我衷心希望这些建议能让我们大家都受益。",
