        "promptEn": "Suppose the business school of your university is conducting a survey to collect students' opinions on the express delivery service industry in China. You are to write a response about its recent development and its impact on people's lives. You will have 30 minutes to write the essay. You should write at least 120 words but no more than 180 words.",
        "promptZh": "学校商学院开展调查征集学生对快递行业的看法，要求写文评述其近期发展及对人们生活的影响。",
        "modelEssay": "As a student invited to share my views in this survey, I am glad to comment on the express delivery industry in China, which has grown at an astonishing pace in recent years.\n\nTo begin with, the recent development of this industry is remarkable. Delivery networks now reach even remote villages, and parcels that once took a week can be delivered overnight. Smart lockers and automated sorting centres, powered by big data, have made the whole process faster and more accurate than ever before.\n\nMore importantly, this development has reshaped our daily lives. With reliable next-day delivery, people can shop online for almost anything, from food to books, without leaving home. Such convenience saves us time and energy, and it has also created millions of jobs for delivery workers across the country.\n\nIn conclusion, China's express delivery industry has advanced rapidly and brought real benefits to ordinary people. I firmly believe it will continue to make our lives even more convenient.",
        "modelEssayZh": "作为一名受邀在本次调查中分享看法的学生，我很乐意就中国的快递行业谈谈自己的观点——这个行业近年来以惊人的速度成长。\n首先，这个行业近期的发展令人瞩目。如今快递网络甚至覆盖到偏远的乡村，过去要一周才能送到的包裹现在可以隔夜送达。由大数据驱动的智能快递柜和自动分拣中心，让整个流程比以往更快、更准确。\n更重要的是，这种发展重塑了我们的日常生活。有了可靠的次日达，人们足不出户就能在网上购买几乎任何东西，从食品到书籍。这样的便利为我们节省了时间和精力，也为全国的快递从业者创造了数百万个工作岗位。\n总之，中国的快递行业发展迅速，给普通人带来了实实在在的好处。我坚信它会继续让我们的生活变得更加便利。",
