        "promptEn": "Suppose your university is seeking students’ opinions on whether university sports facilities should be open to the public. You are now to write an essay to express your view. You will have 30 minutes for the task. You should write at least 120 words but no more than 180 words.",
        "promptZh": "学校就『大学体育设施是否应向公众开放』征求意见，写短文表达你的观点，120—180词。",
        "modelEssay": "In my view, university sports facilities should be opened to the public rather than kept behind closed gates. In the following paragraphs I will give my reasons.\n\nTo begin with, these facilities are usually built with public funding, yet they stand empty on weekends and holidays. Opening them turns a wasted resource into a shared benefit for taxpayers. What is more, many communities lack affordable places to exercise, so free access to a campus track or gym would clearly improve residents' health. Admittedly, some people worry about campus safety and extra costs. Nevertheless, these problems can be eased by fixed opening hours, an entry registration and a small fee.\n\nTo sum up, I firmly believe that universities should open their sports facilities to the public. It is advisable that they first set up proper management, so that both students and residents can enjoy the resource in harmony.",
        "modelEssayZh": "在我看来，大学的体育设施应当向公众开放，而不是紧锁大门。下面我将给出我的理由。\n首先，这些设施通常是用公共资金建成的，可周末和假期却空置在那里。把它们开放，能把闲置浪费变成惠及纳税人的共享资源。此外，许多社区缺少可负担的锻炼场所，因此免费使用校园跑道或场馆显然能改善居民的健康。诚然，有人担心校园安全和额外成本。然而，这些问题可以通过固定的开放时段、入场登记和小额收费来缓解。\n总之，我坚定地认为大学应当向公众开放其体育设施。建议校方先建立起妥善的管理，使学生和居民都能和谐地享用这一资源。",
