        "id": "translation-2023-12-3",
        "type": "translation",
        "title": "Part IV 翻译",
        "short": "翻译",
        "minutes": 30,
        "original": "改革开放以来，中国人民生活水平不断提高，这在人们的饮食 (diet)变化上得到充分体现 。如今，人们不再满足于吃得饱，而是追求吃得更加安全、更加营养、更加健康，食物也愈来愈丰富多样，不再限于本地的农产品。物流业 (logistics industry)的发展使人们很容易品尝到全国各地的特产。毫无疑问，食品质量与饮食结构的改善为增进人们健康提供了有力的保障。",
        "reference": "Since the reform and opening-up, the living standards of the Chinese people have improved steadily, which is fully reflected in the changes in people's diet. Today, people are no longer content with simply having enough to eat; instead, they pursue food that is safer, more nutritious and healthier. Food is also becoming more and more diverse, no longer being limited to local agricultural products. The development of the logistics industry makes it easy for people to taste specialties from all over the country. Undoubtedly, the improvement in food quality and diet structure provides a strong guarantee for improving people's health. 【衔接】第1句到第2句：用 Today 自然承接时间线第1句以 Since the reform and opening-up 起头讲「以来的变化」，第2句 如今正好用 Today 起头收到当下，时间线从「改革开放以来」推进到「如今」，无需额外关联词，靠这两个时间状语本身就连贯。 第2句内部：用分号/instead 显出「不再…而是…」的转折人们不再满足于吃得饱，而是追求的「不是…而是…」是对比转折，英文在 are no longer content... 与 they pursue... 之间用分号加 instead 承接，把「否定旧状态、肯定新追求」的对比显化出来，比一个 but 更清楚。 第3句到第4句：用 Undoubtedly 收束为结论第3句讲物流让人尝到各地特产（饮食更丰富的原因之一），第4句 毫无疑问用 Undoubtedly 起头，把前文铺陈收束为一个总结性结论，语气上自然成为全篇收尾。",
        "keyPhrases": [
          {
            "cn": "改革开放以来，中国人民生活水平不断提高，这在人们的饮食 (diet)变化上得到充分体现。",
            "en": "Since the reform and opening-up, the living standards of the Chinese people have improved steadily, which is fully reflected in the changes in people's diet."
          },
          {
            "cn": "如今，人们不再满足于吃得饱，而是追求吃得更加安全、更加营养、更加健康，食物也愈来愈丰富多样，不再限于本地的农产品。",
            "en": "Today, people are no longer content with simply having enough to eat; instead, they pursue food that is safer, more nutritious and healthier. Food is also becoming more and more diverse, no longer being limited to local agricultural products."
          },
          {
            "cn": "物流业 (logistics industry)的发展使人们很容易品尝到全国各地的特产。",
            "en": "The development of the logistics industry makes it easy for people to taste specialties from all over the country."
          },
          {
            "cn": "毫无疑问，食品质量与饮食结构的改善为增进人们健康提供了有力的保障。",
            "en": "Undoubtedly, the improvement in food quality and diet structure provides a strong guarantee for improving people's health."
          }
        ],
