        "promptEn": "Suppose the university newspaper is inviting submissions from the students for its coming edition on a campus event that has impressed them most. You are now to write an essay for submission. You will have 30 minutes to write the essay. You should write at least 120 words but no more than 180 words.",
        "promptZh": "假定校报就『最令你印象深刻的校园活动』向学生征稿，写一篇投稿短文，120—180词。",
        "modelEssay": "Among all the campus events I have taken part in, a volunteer teaching trip impressed me the most. It was last autumn that I joined our university volunteer team and traveled to a small rural primary school.\n\nI still remember the moment when I walked into that simple classroom and began my first English lesson. The children sat straight, their eyes shining with curiosity, and they repeated every new word after me as loudly as they could. When the bell rang, instead of running out to play, they crowded around my desk, asking how to pronounce the words on their notebooks. At that moment, I felt truly needed for the first time, and a warm sense of responsibility rose in my heart.\n\nThis experience taught me that knowledge is not only something for exams, but also a light that can warm and guide others. That is exactly why this volunteer trip remains the campus event that touches me most.",
        "modelEssayZh": "在我参加过的所有校园活动中，一次志愿支教之行最令我印象深刻。去年秋天，我加入了学校的志愿队，前往一所偏远的乡村小学。\n我至今仍记得走进那间简陋教室、开始我第一堂英语课的那一刻。孩子们坐得笔直，眼睛里闪着好奇的光，跟着我尽可能大声地重复每一个新单词。下课铃响时，他们没有跑出去玩，而是围到我的桌前，问我笔记本上的单词该怎么读。那一刻，我第一次感到自己真正被需要，一种温暖的责任感在心中升起。\n这次经历让我明白，知识不只是用来考试的东西，更是一束能温暖和指引他人的光。这正是这次志愿之行至今仍最打动我的原因。",
