        "short": "写作",
        "minutes": 30,
        "promptEn": "Suppose the student union of your university is organizing an online discussion on college students doing community service. You are to write an essay on its benefits and the service you can provide to the community. You will have 30 minutes for the task. You should write at least 120 words but no more than 180 words.",
        "promptZh": "假定校学生会就大学生做社区服务组织线上讨论，写短文谈其益处及自己能提供的社区服务，120—180词。",
        "modelEssay": "These days, more and more college students are getting involved in community service. In my view, this is a meaningful practice that benefits both the community and ourselves.\n\nCommunity service brings benefits to both society and the people who offer it. On the one hand, it warms our neighborhood: by visiting lonely elderly people or helping local children with their studies, we deliver real care to those in need. On the other hand, it shapes us as individuals, since serving others trains our communication skills and sense of responsibility. As for me, the service I can provide is teaching English. Being good at this subject, I plan to offer free English lessons to children in my community every weekend, so that they can enjoy learning and grow with confidence.\n\nIn short, doing community service is well worth our effort, as it helps others and improves ourselves at the same time. I sincerely hope that more of us will step out and act.",
        "modelEssayZh": "如今，越来越多的大学生开始参与社区服务。在我看来，这是一件有意义的事，它既造福社区，也成就我们自己。\n社区服务对社会和服务者本人都有好处。一方面，它温暖着我们的社区：通过探望孤独的老人、辅导社区的孩子学习，我们把真切的关怀送到有需要的人身边。另一方面，它也塑造着我们自己，因为服务他人能锻炼我们的沟通能力和责任感。就我而言，我能提供的服务是教英语。我擅长这门学科，打算每个周末为社区里的孩子免费上英语课，让他们乐于学习、在自信中成长。\n总之，做社区服务很值得我们付出，因为它在帮助他人的同时也提升了自己。我衷心希望我们当中有更多人能走出去、行动起来。",
