        "promptEn": "Suppose the student union of your university is organizing an online discussion on interpersonal relationships. You are to write an essay on ways to maintain a warm and friendly relationship with your classmates and on the benefits of such a relationship. You will have 30 minutes f or the task. You should write at least 120 words but no more than 180 words .",
        "promptZh": "假定校学生会就人际关系组织线上讨论，写短文说明与同学保持温暖友好关系的方法及其益处，120—180词。",
        "modelEssay": "A warm and friendly relationship plays an important part in our campus life. Since we spend most of our time with classmates, it is worth thinking about how to maintain such a relationship and what benefits it can bring.\n\nThere are several practical ways to keep such a relationship close. First, we should communicate sincerely. For example, when a misunderstanding happens, we can simply talk it over honestly instead of staying cold. Besides, it also helps to support each other in study and daily life. When a classmate misses a lecture, sharing our notes and showing respect for different habits can quickly bring us closer.\n\nAs a result, such a relationship can bring us real benefits. It eases our pressure when courses get hard, pushes us to make progress together, and creates a strong sense of belonging in class. In short, building such warm bonds with our classmates is well worth our effort throughout the precious college years.",
        "modelEssayZh": "温暖友好的关系在我们的校园生活中占有重要位置。既然我们大部分时间都和同学在一起，那么思考一下怎样维系这样的关系、它又能带来哪些好处，就很有必要。\n维系这样亲密关系有几条切实可行的做法。第一，我们应当真诚地沟通。比如，当产生误会时，我们大可坦诚地把话说开，而不是冷脸相对。此外，在学习和生活上彼此支持也很有帮助。当一位同学缺了一节课，分享笔记、尊重彼此不同的习惯，就能很快拉近我们的距离。\n这样一来，这样的关系便能带给我们实实在在的好处。它能在课程吃力时缓解我们的压力，推动我们共同进步，并在班级里营造出强烈的归属感。总之，与同学建立这样温暖的纽带，在宝贵的大学岁月里非常值得我们用心去做。",
