        "minutes": 30,
        "promptEn": "For this part, you are allowed 30 minutes to write an essay that begins with the sentence \"Today there is a growing awareness that mental well-being needs to be given as much attention as physical health.\" You can make comments, cite examples or use your personal experiences to develop your essay. You should write at least 120 words but no more than 180 words.",
        "promptZh": "以指定句『心理健康应与身体健康受到同等关注』开头写一篇短文，可评论、举例或结合个人经历，120—180词。",
        "modelEssay": "Today there is a growing awareness that mental well-being needs to be given as much attention as physical health. This view deserves our serious attention, especially when modern life keeps us under constant pressure and quiet mental troubles often go unnoticed.\n\nTo begin with, ignoring our inner state can cost us dearly. Long-term stress and anxiety lead to sleeplessness and poor concentration, which in turn damage both our bodies and our performance. Take my own experience as an example: before an important exam, I was so anxious that I could not sleep for nights and ended up doing far worse than usual. Only after I talked to my friends and kept a regular routine did my mind settle down and my results recover. This taught me that the mind clearly deserves the same care we give the body.\n\nIn conclusion, we should value our minds as much as our bodies. Only when individuals pay attention to their feelings and society offers more support can we truly live a healthy and balanced life.",
        "modelEssayZh": "如今，人们越来越意识到，心理健康需要得到与身体健康同等的重视。这一观点值得我们认真对待，尤其是在现代生活让我们持续承受压力、悄无声息的心理困扰常被忽视的当下。\n首先，忽视我们的内在状态会让我们付出沉重代价。长期的压力与焦虑会导致失眠和注意力涣散，进而损害我们的身体与表现。以我自己的经历为例：一次重要考试前，我焦虑到接连几晚无法入睡，最终考得远不如往常。直到我向朋友倾诉、保持规律作息，我的心态才安定下来，成绩也随之恢复。这让我明白，心灵显然值得我们给予如同照料身体一样的呵护。\n总之，我们应当像重视身体一样重视心灵。唯有当个人关注自己的感受、社会提供更多支持，我们才能真正过上健康而均衡的生活。",
