        "id": "translation-2023-06-1",
        "type": "translation",
        "title": "Part IV 翻译",
        "short": "翻译",
        "minutes": 30,
        "original": "中国越来越重视终身教育,发展继续教育是构建终身教育体系的有效途径。高校作为人才培养的基地, 拥有先进的教学理念和优越的教学资源, 理应成为继续教育的办学主体。因此，近年来许多高校适应社会需求, 加强与用人单位沟通, 努力探索一条符合中国国情的继续教育发展新路, 以使继续教育在国家发展战略中发挥更大的作用。",
        "reference": "China attaches increasing importance to lifelong education, and developing continuing education is an effective way to build a lifelong education system. As a base for cultivating talent, universities, possessing advanced teaching philosophies and superior teaching resources, should be the main providers of continuing education. Therefore, in recent years, many universities have been exploring a new path of continuing education that suits China's national conditions by adapting to social needs and strengthening communication with employers, so as to enable continuing education to play a greater role in the national development strategy. 【衔接】第1句与第2句之间：用主题衔接，避免重复 continuing education第1句尾落在 lifelong education system，第2句承接谈‘高校该当继续教育的主体’，话题自然顺承，无须硬加关联词。注意第2句主语直接用 universities 即可，不必回指上句。 第2句与第3句之间：用 Therefore 显出因果中文 因此 已点明第3句是承前两句（高校理应成为主体）而来的行动结果，英文定稿在第3句句首保留 Therefore，把这层因果显化，让整篇逻辑链清晰。 第3句内部：用 continuing education 串起首尾，保持术语一致第3句既出现 a new path of continuing education，末尾又 enable continuing education to play a greater role，前后都用同一译法 continuing education 承接同一概念，整篇术语统一、读着连贯。",
        "keyPhrases": [
          {
            "cn": "中国越来越重视终身教育,发展继续教育是构建终身教育体系的有效途径。",
            "en": "China attaches increasing importance to lifelong education, and developing continuing education is an effective way to build a lifelong education system."
          },
          {
            "cn": "高校作为人才培养的基地, 拥有先进的教学理念和优越的教学资源, 理应成为继续教育的办学主体。",
            "en": "As a base for cultivating talent, universities, possessing advanced teaching philosophies and superior teaching resources, should be the main providers of continuing education."
          },
          {
            "cn": "因此，近年来许多高校适应社会需求, 加强与用人单位沟通, 努力探索一条符合中国国情的继续教育发展新路, 以使继续教育在国家发展战略中发挥更大的作用。",
            "en": "Therefore, in recent years, many universities have been exploring a new path of continuing education that suits China's national conditions by adapting to social needs and strengthening communication with employers, so as to enable continuing education to play a greater role in the national development strategy."
          }
        ],
