        "promptEn": "In this task, you are to write an essay on the necessity of developing social skills for college students. You will have 30 minutes for the task. You should write at least 120 words but no more than 180 words.",
        "promptZh": "写一篇议论文，论述大学生培养社交技能的必要性。",
        "modelEssay": "In today's interconnected campus life, the necessity of developing social skills for college students can hardly be overstated. Far from being an optional extra, the ability to communicate and cooperate is indispensable to a student's growth.\n\nTo begin with, strong social skills lie at the heart of academic success. Much college learning happens through group projects, seminars and lab work, where students who express ideas clearly and listen to others achieve far more than those who work in isolation. Moreover, these skills pave the way for future careers. Employers today value teamwork and communication as highly as professional knowledge, and graduates who can network and collaborate stand out in interviews. Equally important, good social skills help students build friendships, ease loneliness and adapt to campus life smoothly.\n\nTherefore, developing social skills is by no means a trivial matter but a genuine necessity for every college student. Universities and students alike should treat it as seriously as academic study, so that young people can thrive both on campus and beyond.",
        "modelEssayZh": "在当今高度互联的校园生活中，大学生培养社交能力的必要性怎么强调都不为过。沟通与合作的能力绝非可有可无的点缀，而是对学生成长不可或缺的。\n首先，过硬的社交能力是学业成功的核心所在。大学学习大量通过小组项目、研讨课和实验完成，能清晰表达、善于倾听的学生远比孤立埋头者收获更多。此外，这些能力为未来的职业铺平道路。如今用人单位把团队协作与沟通看得和专业知识一样重，会拓展人脉、懂得协作的毕业生在面试中更为突出。同样重要的是，良好的社交能力帮助学生建立友谊、缓解孤独，并顺利适应校园生活。\n因此，培养社交能力绝非无关紧要的小事，而是每个大学生真切的必要。学校与学生都应像重视学业一样重视它，从而让年轻人在校内外都能茁壮成长。",
