        "modelEssay": "A healthy lifestyle plays a vital role in the life of every college student. As campus life grows busier with assignments and screens, I firmly believe that keeping fit, eating well and sleeping regularly is not a trivial habit but the very foundation of a successful university experience.\n\nFor one thing, a sound body directly boosts learning efficiency. A student who stays up all night rushing a due date and lives on takeout will struggle to concentrate the next morning, while regular exercise and balanced meals keep the mind sharp in class. For another, a healthy routine stabilizes our emotions. Sitting still for hours breeds anxiety, whereas a short run often washes away the pressure of exams and eases loneliness far from home.\n\nIn conclusion, a healthy lifestyle is not optional but essential for college students. The sooner we build it, the more energy and confidence we will carry into our studies and future lives.",
        "modelEssayZh": "健康的生活方式在每一位大学生的生活中都起着至关重要的作用。随着课业与屏幕让校园生活越来越忙，我坚信保持锻炼、好好吃饭、规律睡眠并非无关紧要的小习惯，而是成功大学生活的根基。\n一方面，健康的身体直接提升学习效率。一个通宵赶due、靠外卖度日的学生第二天很难集中注意力，而规律的锻炼和均衡的饮食能让人上课时头脑清醒。另一方面，健康的作息能稳定我们的情绪。久坐数小时会滋生焦虑，而一次短跑往往能冲走考试的压力、缓解远离家乡的孤独。\n总之，健康的生活方式对大学生而言不是可选项，而是必需品。我们越早养成它，就能带着越多的精力与自信投入学业和未来的人生。",
