            "answer": "C",
            "explanation": "选 C。C 段We say \"yes\" to many requests not because we want to do them, but because we don't want to be seen as rude or unhelpful. 我们答应许多请求，不是因为想做，而是因为不想被看作无礼或不肯帮忙。"
