        "promptEn": "In this task, you are to write an essay on the role of physical exercise in achieving success at college. You will have 30 minutes for the task. You should write at least 120 words but no more than 180 words.",
        "promptZh": "写一篇议论文，论述体育锻炼对取得大学成功的作用。",
        "modelEssay": "While many college students bury themselves in books and treat workouts as a waste of time, it is often overlooked that physical exercise plays an indispensable role in achieving success at college. In my view, staying active is not the enemy of study but its solid foundation.\n\nFirst, regular exercise strengthens the body and guarantees the energy that intense coursework demands. A student who jogs every morning is more likely to stay focused through back-to-back lectures than one who never moves. Moreover, working out is a powerful way to relieve stress. When exams and job hunting pile up, a quick run on the track can wash away tension and rebuild mental resilience. In addition, sticking to a fixed exercise routine cultivates self-discipline, and this habit naturally transfers to managing study plans on time.\n\nIn short, physical exercise is by no means a distraction; rather, it is the cornerstone of college success. Therefore, every student is advised to fit regular workouts into daily life before body and mind break down.",
        "modelEssayZh": "当许多大学生埋头书本、把锻炼当作浪费时间时，人们常常忽视：体育锻炼在大学取得成功中扮演着不可或缺的角色。在我看来，保持运动并非学习的敌人，而是它坚实的根基。\n首先，规律锻炼能强健体魄，保障密集课业所需要的精力。一个每天晨跑的学生，比一个从不运动的学生更可能在连堂课中保持专注。此外，锻炼是缓解压力的有力方式。当考试和求职接踵而来，操场上一次短跑就能驱散紧张、重建心理韧性。另外，坚持固定的锻炼作息能培养自律，而这一习惯会自然迁移到按时管理学习计划上。\n简而言之，体育锻炼绝非干扰，而是大学成功的基石。因此，建议每位同学在身心垮掉之前，就把规律锻炼纳入日常生活。",
