        "short": "写作",
        "minutes": 30,
        "promptEn": "Suppose your class plans to invite some former graduates to share their job experiences with the students. As the organizer of the activity, you are now to write an invitation letter to the invited speakers on behalf of your class. You will have 30 minutes to write the letter.You should write at least 120 words but no more than 180 words.",
        "promptZh": "以班级组织者身份写一封邀请信，邀请毕业校友返校分享求职与工作经验。",
        "modelEssay": "Dear Sir or Madam,\n\nOn behalf of Class One, I am writing to cordially invite you to our upcoming career-sharing session. As a distinguished graduate of our school who has achieved much in the workplace, you are exactly the speaker our students long to hear from.\n\nOur class is organizing this activity because many current students feel anxious about job hunting and future careers. We believe your first-hand experience in seeking employment and adapting to work would offer them invaluable guidance and encouragement. The talk is scheduled for 2:00 p.m. next Friday in Lecture Hall 3, and will last about an hour, followed by a free question-and-answer session.\n\nIt would mean a great deal to us if you could accept this invitation. Please kindly reply by email before this Wednesday to confirm your attendance. We sincerely look forward to your inspiring presence.\n\nYours sincerely,\n\nLi Ming",
        "modelEssayZh": "尊敬的先生／女士：\n我谨代表一班，诚挚地邀请您参加我们即将举办的职业经验分享会。作为一位在职场颇有成就的杰出校友，您正是同学们渴望聆听的分享人。\n我们班举办这次活动，是因为许多在校同学对求职和未来的职业发展感到焦虑。我们相信，您在求职与适应工作方面的第一手经历，将给他们带来无比宝贵的指引与鼓舞。分享会定于下周五下午两点在第三讲学厅举行，约一小时，随后设自由问答环节。\n若您能接受此次邀请，对我们而言意义非凡。烦请您于本周三前回复邮件，确认是否出席。我们由衷期待您的莅临与精彩分享。\n此致\n敬礼\n李明",
