        "modelEssay": "A Report on Teachers' Day Celebration\n\nOn September 10th, our class held a warm celebration to mark Teachers' Day and to show our gratitude to all our teachers. The event took place in Classroom 305 and was attended by every student as well as three of our subject teachers.\n\nThe celebration was filled with carefully prepared activities. To begin with, we decorated the classroom with balloons and handwritten cards. Then several students performed songs and a short play, while others presented flowers and small gifts. What moved everyone most was a video in which we collected our thanks to our teachers.\n\nThe celebration turned out to be a great success. Our teachers were deeply touched, and some of them could hardly hold back their tears. Through this activity, we not only expressed our respect but also drew closer to one another. It was surely a Teachers' Day none of us will ever forget.",
        "modelEssayZh": "教师节庆祝活动报道\n9月10日，我们班举办了一场温馨的庆祝活动，庆祝教师节，向所有老师表达感激之情。活动在305教室举行，全班同学以及三位任课老师都参加了。\n这场庆祝活动安排了精心准备的各项内容。首先，我们用气球和手写贺卡装饰了教室。随后，几名同学表演了歌曲和一出短剧，另一些同学则献上鲜花和小礼物。最令大家动容的是一段视频，里面汇集了我们对老师的感谢。\n这场庆祝活动圆满成功。老师们深受感动，有几位几乎忍不住落泪。通过这次活动，我们不仅表达了敬意，也彼此更加亲近。这真是一个我们谁都不会忘记的教师节。",
