        "modelEssay": "Dear Sir or Madam,\n\nI am writing to apply for the position of a volunteer teacher for children in remote rural areas during the coming vacation. The main reason I want to take part is my genuine love for education. Two years ago, I tutored a left-behind child in my hometown, and watching her grow more confident convinced me that teaching can truly change lives. Joining this program is my way of giving back to society.\n\nAs for what I can do, I major in English, so I am confident that I can teach the kids basic spoken English and help them with their homework. Besides, I enjoy singing and drawing, and I would like to organize after-class activities to make learning both fun and warm for them.\n\nI would sincerely appreciate it if I could be given this valuable chance. Thank you for your time and consideration.\n\nYours sincerely,\n\nLi Hua",
