        "promptEn": "Suppose you are going to write a proposal to your school clinic for improving its service. You are to write about its current problems and possible solutions to these problems. You will have 30 minutes to write the proposal. You should write at least 120 words but no more than 180 words.",
        "promptZh": "向校医院写一份建议书，说明其目前存在的问题并提出解决办法。",
        "modelEssay": "Dear School Administration,\n\nI am a student of our university, and I am writing to put forward a few suggestions on improving the service of our school clinic, which I hope will make it more helpful to all students.\n\nAt present, the clinic faces several problems. First, registration often takes a long time, so students have to wait in a long line before seeing a doctor. Second, the medical staff are too few, which makes the service slow. Besides, the range of available medicines is quite limited, and the opening hours are inconvenient for those with classes in the daytime.\n\nTo solve these problems, some measures could be taken. It is suggested that an online registration system be set up to save waiting time. In addition, the clinic could hire more doctors and nurses and stock a wider range of common medicines. Extending the opening hours into the evening would also be a great help.\n\nI would appreciate it if these suggestions could be considered.\n\nYours sincerely,\n\nLi Ming",
        "modelEssayZh": "尊敬的校方管理层：\n我是本校的一名学生，写这封信是想就改进我校校医院的服务提几点建议，希望能让它对全体同学更有帮助。\n目前，校医院存在几个问题。第一，挂号往往要花很长时间，学生看病前得排很长的队。第二，医护人员太少，使得就诊速度很慢。此外，可选药品的种类相当有限，而且开放时间对白天有课的同学很不方便。\n为解决这些问题，可以采取一些措施。建议上线一套在线挂号系统以节省排队时间。此外，校医院可以增聘医生和护士，并储备种类更全的常用药品。把开放时间延长到晚上也会大有帮助。\n如果这些建议能被采纳，我将不胜感激。\n此致，\n李明",
