        "promptEn": "Suppose you are going to write a proposal to your student union for enriching students’ extracurricular activities. You are to write about what activities to organize and why. You will have 30 minutes to write the proposal. You should write at least 120 words but no more than 180 words.",
        "promptZh": "向学生会写一份建议书，提出可组织哪些课外活动并说明理由。",
        "modelEssay": "A Proposal on Enriching Extracurricular Activities\n\nI am writing to propose a few extracurricular activities that our student union could organize, in the hope of making our campus life more colorful and rewarding.\n\nTo begin with, I would suggest holding a monthly book-sharing club. Since many of us read alone and seldom exchange thoughts, such a club would offer a regular chance to share insights, broaden our horizons and improve our critical thinking.\n\nIn addition, I recommend arranging weekend volunteer trips to nearby communities. These activities would not only allow us to apply what we learn in real life, but also cultivate a stronger sense of social responsibility and teamwork among students.\n\nI sincerely hope the student union will take these suggestions into consideration. Your support would mean a great deal to all of us. Thank you for your time and attention.",
        "modelEssayZh": "一份关于丰富课外活动的建议书\n我写这封信，是想向学生会提出几项课外活动的建议，希望能让我们的校园生活更加丰富多彩、更有收获。\n首先，我建议每月举办一次读书分享会。由于许多同学都是独自阅读、很少交流想法，这样的活动能提供一个固定的场合，让大家分享见解、开阔视野、提升思辨能力。\n此外，我建议在周末组织前往附近社区的志愿服务活动。这类活动不仅能让我们把所学用于现实生活，还能培养更强的社会责任感和同学之间的团队精神。\n我真诚地希望学生会能考虑采纳这些建议。你们的支持对我们所有人来说都意义重大。感谢你们的时间与关注。",
