        "promptEn": "Suppose you are going to write a proposal to your school library for improving its service. You are to write about its current problems and possible solutions to these problems. You will have 30 minutes to write the proposal. You should write at least 120 words but no more than 180 words.",
        "promptZh": "向学校图书馆写一份建议书，说明其目前存在的问题并提出改进办法。",
        "modelEssay": "I am a sophomore who spends most of my free time studying in our school library. As a frequent user, I am writing to propose several improvements that I believe would enhance its service.\n\nTwo problems stand out. First, the library closes at nine every evening, which is too early for students who prepare for exams late at night; I suggest extending the opening hours to eleven during examination weeks. Second, the reading area is often noisy because there is no separated quiet zone, so it is hard to concentrate. It would be advisable to set aside a silent room and remind readers to keep their voices down.\n\nI believe these changes are simple yet effective, and they would make the library far more welcoming to every student. Thank you very much for considering my suggestions, and I sincerely hope they can be adopted soon.",
        "modelEssayZh": "我是一名大二学生，空闲时间大多在学校图书馆自习。作为一名常客，我写这封建议书，想提出几点我认为能提升图书馆服务的改进意见。\n有两个问题比较突出。第一，图书馆每晚九点就关门，对于熬夜备考的同学来说太早了；我建议在考试周把开放时间延长到十一点。第二，阅览区常常很吵，因为没有单独的安静区，很难专心。设立一间静音自习室、并提醒读者小声说话，会是可取的做法。\n我相信这些改动简单却有效，能让图书馆对每一位同学都更友好。非常感谢您考虑我的建议，也真诚希望它们能尽快被采纳。",
