        "id": "translation-2022-06-1",
        "type": "translation",
        "title": "Part IV 翻译",
        "short": "翻译",
        "minutes": 30,
        "original": "从前有个农夫嫌他种的禾苗长得慢，就到地里把禾苗一株株地拔高了一点。回家后他对家人说：\"今天可真把我累坏了！但我总算让禾苗一下子长高了。\"他儿子到地里去一看，禾苗都已死光了。 现在有些家长急于让孩子成功，往往步那个农夫的后尘，搞得孩子苦不堪言，却不见孩子学业长进。这样的家长是否该对这个问题有所醒悟，让孩子自然成长呢？",
        "reference": "Once upon a time, a farmer, thinking that the rice seedlings he had planted were growing too slowly, went into the field and pulled them up one by one to make each a little taller. After returning home, he told his family, \"I'm really worn out today, but I have finally made the rice seedlings grow taller all at once!\" When his son went to the field, he found that all the rice seedlings had already withered. Nowadays, some parents, eager to see their children succeed, often follow in the farmer's footsteps, causing their children great suffering, yet seeing no progress in their studies. Shouldn't such parents wake up to this problem and let their children grow naturally? 【衔接】句1→句2 用时间副词 Then 串起回家这一动作句1结束于\"拔高了一点\"，句2开头 回家后 已经做了时间过渡。英文译文 After returning home 本身就是衔接词；若想更口语化也可用 Then he went home and told his family，但 After returning home 更书面、更紧凑。 句2→句3 用 his son 而非 the son 承接句2主语是\"他\"（the farmer），句3 他儿子 用所有格 his son 自然承接前句的 he，避免重复\"the farmer's son\"。这是英文用代词承接避重复的典型做法。 句3→句4 用 Nowadays 切换时间层前三句是寓言（过去时），句4起转到当下议论（现在时）。中文 现在 已是切换信号，英文用 Nowadays 提到句首，把\"故事讲完、转入现实\"挑明，读者一眼看出语体转换。 句4→句5 用 such parents 回指避免重复句4说了 some parents...，句5 这样的家长 用 such parents 回指、不重复 some parents；such 比 these 更显\"这一类\"的概括义，跟反问劝告的语气也更契合。",
        "keyPhrases": [
          {
            "cn": "从前有个农夫嫌他种的禾苗长得慢，就到地里把禾苗一株株地拔高了一点。",
            "en": "Once upon a time, a farmer, thinking that the rice seedlings he had planted were growing too slowly, went into the field and pulled them up one by one to make each a little taller."
          },
          {
            "cn": "回家后他对家人说：\"今天可真把我累坏了！但我总算让禾苗一下子长高了。\"",
            "en": "After returning home, he told his family, \"I'm really worn out today, but I have finally made the rice seedlings grow taller all at once!\""
          },
          {
            "cn": "他儿子到地里去一看，禾苗都已死光了。",
            "en": "When his son went to the field, he found that all the rice seedlings had already withered."
          },
          {
            "cn": "现在有些家长急于让孩子成功，往往步那个农夫的后尘，搞得孩子苦不堪言，却不见孩子学业长进。",
            "en": "Nowadays, some parents, eager to see their children succeed, often follow in the farmer's footsteps, causing their children great suffering, yet seeing no progress in their studies."
          },
          {
            "cn": "这样的家长是否该对这个问题有所醒悟，让孩子自然成长呢？",
            "en": "Shouldn't such parents wake up to this problem and let their children grow naturally?"
          }
        ],
