        "promptEn": "Suppose you have just participated in a school project of collecting used books on campus. You are now to write a report about the project, which may include its aim, organizers, participants and activities. You will have 30 minutes to write the report. You should write at least 120 words but no more than 180 words.",
        "promptZh": "就参加过的校园旧书回收活动写一篇报告，可包括目的、组织者、参与者和活动内容。",
        "modelEssay": "A Report on the Used-Book Collection\n\nLast week, a book-collecting project was successfully carried out on our campus, aiming to give idle used books a second life and to help students in need. By gathering textbooks and novels that lay unused on shelves, the project hoped to promote recycling and ease the burden of buying new books.\n\nThe project was organized by the Student Union, with strong support from the school library. It attracted a wide range of participants: undergraduates from every department, several teachers, and a group of enthusiastic volunteers. Together they set up donation booths, sorted and classified the collected books, and recorded each contribution carefully. Some volunteers also repaired damaged covers and delivered the books to a nearby rural school.\n\nThanks to everyone's effort, more than two thousand books were collected. The activity not only enriched the campus reading atmosphere but also spread the spirit of sharing and thrift among students.",
        "modelEssayZh": "一份关于旧书回收活动的报告\n上周，我校成功开展了一次收书活动，旨在让闲置的旧书获得第二次生命，并帮助有需要的同学。通过收集那些搁在书架上无人使用的教材和小说，本项目希望推动回收利用，减轻购买新书的负担。\n本次项目由学生会组织，并得到学校图书馆的大力支持。它吸引了各类参与者：来自各院系的本科生、几位老师，以及一群热心的志愿者。大家一起设立募捐点，对收来的书籍进行分类整理，并认真登记每一笔捐赠。一些志愿者还修补了破损的书皮，把书送到附近的一所乡村学校。\n多亏了大家的努力，共收到了两千多册图书。这次活动不仅丰富了校园的阅读氛围，也在同学们中间传播了分享与节约的精神。",
