        "promptEn": "Suppose your university student union is planning to hold a speech contest. You are now to write a proposal for organizing the contest. The proposal may include the topic, aim , procedure and selection of contestants. You will have 30 minutes to write the proposal. You should write at least 120 words but no more than 180 words.",
        "promptZh": "为学生会筹办演讲比赛写一份建议书，可包括主题、目的、流程和选手选拔办法。",
        "modelEssay": "A Proposal for a Speech Contest\n\nOn behalf of the Student Union, I am writing to propose that our university hold a campus speech contest next month, and the details are outlined below for your approval.\n\nThe contest will focus on the theme \"My Chinese Dream.\" Our aim is to sharpen students' public-speaking skills, build their confidence, and enrich campus cultural life.\n\nAs for the procedure, we will first post a notice to call for entries. Then a preliminary round will be held in each college. Finally, twelve finalists will deliver their speeches on stage, scored by a panel of teachers and students.\n\nThe selection of contestants will be fair and open: applicants must submit a written draft, and those with clear ideas and fluent expression will be shortlisted through a short interview. We sincerely hope you will approve this proposal, and any suggestions would be warmly welcomed.\n\nThe Student Union",
        "modelEssayZh": "一份演讲比赛方案\n谨代表学生会，我写此提案，建议我校于下月举办一场校园演讲比赛，具体细节列于下文，恳请批准。\n本次比赛以「我的中国梦」为主题。我们的目的是锻炼同学们的公众演讲能力、增强他们的自信，并丰富校园文化生活。\n关于比赛流程，我们将先张贴通知征集报名；随后在各院系举办初赛；最后，十二名决赛选手将登台演讲，由师生组成的评委团打分。\n选手选拔将公平公开：报名者须提交一份书面讲稿，思路清晰、表达流畅者将经过一次简短面试择优入围。我们衷心希望您能批准这份提案，也十分欢迎任何建议。\n学生会",
