        "id": "translation-2021-12-2",
        "type": "translation",
        "title": "Part IV 翻译",
        "short": "翻译",
        "minutes": 30,
        "original": "坎儿井(Karez)是新疆干旱地区的一种水利系统，由地下渠道将水井连接而成。该系统将春夏季节渗入 (seep into) 地下的大量雨水及积雪融水收集起来，通过山体的自然坡度引到地面，用于灌溉农田和满足人们的日常用水需求。坎儿井减少了水在地面的蒸发 (evaporation), 对地表破坏很小，因而有效地保护了自然资源与生态环境。坎儿井体现了我国人民与自然和谐共存的智慧，是对人类文明的一大贡献。",
        "reference": "Karez is a water conservancy system in the arid areas of Xinjiang, formed by underground channels that connect a series of wells. The system collects large amounts of rainwater and meltwater that seep into the ground in spring and summer, and channels them to the surface through the natural slope of the mountains to irrigate farmland and meet people's daily water needs. Karez reduces the evaporation of water from the ground and causes little damage to the surface, and thus effectively protects natural resources and the ecological environment. It embodies the wisdom of the Chinese people in living in harmony with nature, and is a great contribution to human civilization. 【衔接】第1句到第2句：用 The system 承接 Karez原文 该系统 就是对前句「坎儿井」的回指，英文里继续用 The system（或 It）承接，避免重复 Karez。这一处把代词/同义指代用好，整段就立刻有了「上下文连接」的感觉，不再像孤立的句子堆。 第2句到第3句：保持主语一致，必要时显化对比第2句讲坎儿井「做什么」，第3句讲它「带来什么好处」，主语都仍是坎儿井。第3句开头直接用 Karez 重新点名一次主语，避免连用三句 it 让读者跟丢；句末再以 and thus 把「减少蒸发、破坏小」与「保护资源环境」的因果显化出来，让逻辑透出来。 第3句到第4句：用结论副词或直接定调收束第4句是全段升华，可在句首加 In short / Overall / 不加（直接 Karez embodies…）。如不加连接词，则靠内容本身的「总结陈述」语气收束；如加，则用 In short, Karez embodies… 把「总结意味」明示出来。两种都可，本译稿选择简洁不加，让结尾收得干脆。",
        "keyPhrases": [
          {
            "cn": "坎儿井(Karez)是新疆干旱地区的一种水利系统，由地下渠道将水井连接而成。",
            "en": "Karez is a water conservancy system in the arid areas of Xinjiang, formed by underground channels that connect a series of wells."
          },
          {
            "cn": "该系统将春夏季节渗入 (seep into) 地下的大量雨水及积雪融水收集起来，通过山体的自然坡度引到地面，用于灌溉农田和满足人们的日常用水需求。",
            "en": "The system collects large amounts of rainwater and meltwater that seep into the ground in spring and summer, and channels them to the surface through the natural slope of the mountains to irrigate farmland and meet people's daily water needs."
          },
          {
            "cn": "坎儿井减少了水在地面的蒸发 (evaporation), 对地表破坏很小，因而有效地保护了自然资源与生态环境。",
            "en": "Karez reduces the evaporation of water from the ground and causes little damage to the surface, and thus effectively protects natural resources and the ecological environment."
          },
          {
            "cn": "坎儿井体现了我国人民与自然和谐共存的智慧，是对人类文明的一大贡献。",
            "en": "Karez embodies the wisdom of the Chinese people in living in harmony with nature, and is a great contribution to human civilization."
          }
        ],
