        "promptEn": "Suppose your school is organizing an orientation program to help the freshmen adapt to the new environment and academic studies. You are now to write a proposal, which may include its aim, duration, participants and activities. You will have 30 minutes to write the proposal. You should write at least 120 words but no more than 180 words.",
        "promptZh": "为帮助新生适应新环境与学业，写一份入学指导项目建议书（含目的、时长、参与者与活动）。",
        "modelEssay": "A Proposal for the Freshmen Orientation Program\n\nOur school is planning an orientation program for this year's freshmen, and its main arrangements are proposed below. The program aims to help new students adapt to the new environment and academic studies as smoothly and quickly as possible.\n\nIn terms of duration, the program will last for one week, starting from the day of registration. As for the participants, it is open to all incoming freshmen, and it will be organized by the Student Union together with volunteer seniors and several advisers from each department.\n\nA variety of activities will be arranged during the week. First, campus tours and library workshops will help newcomers find their way around. Second, group meetings with academic advisers will introduce course selection and effective study methods. Finally, evening social parties will give students a chance to make new friends and relax.\n\nWe are confident that this program will give every freshman a warm and confident start. Your approval and support would be highly appreciated.\n\nThe Student Union",
        "modelEssayZh": "新生入学适应方案\n本校正为今年的新生筹办一个入学适应项目，主要安排如下。该项目旨在帮助新生尽可能顺利、迅速地适应新环境与学业。\n在时长方面，项目为期一周，从报到当天开始。在参与者方面，项目面向全体新生，由学生会联合高年级志愿者和各院系的若干名顾问共同组织。\n这一周将安排多种活动。第一，校园导览和图书馆工作坊帮助新生熟悉校园；第二，与学业顾问的小组见面会介绍选课与有效的学习方法；最后，晚间的社交派对让同学们结交新朋友、放松身心。\n我们相信这个项目会让每位新生拥有一个温暖而自信的开始。恳请校方批准并给予支持。\n学生会",
